beverage and winery permits) filed with the City Clerk’s Office.

ACTION:

8.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending certain sections of Chapter 44, Solid Waste,
and Chapter 56, Noise Control, of Title 8, Health and Safety, and further amending
certain sections of Chapter 8, Offenses Against Public Peace and Decency, and Chapter
12, Offenses Against Property, of Title 9, Public Peace and Welfare, of the Municipal
Code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, to eliminate the potential imposition of a jail
sentence for violation of specified code provisions.

ACTION:

9.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Creating Section 2.40.100, Public Defender and
Representation of Needy Persons; Determination of Need, of Chapter 2.40, Municipal
Court, of Title 2, Administration and Personnel, of the Municipal Code of the City of
Cheyenne, Wyoming, Specifying Public Defender Appointment Procedures and
Standards for Representation in the Municipal Court.

